    "Still expected": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch erwartet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still expected: %@. Confirm instalments one by one as they come in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch erwartet: %@. Bestätige Raten einzeln, sobald sie ankommen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Syncing %lld change(s)…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchronisiere %lld Änderung(en)…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That QR code is not a Group Balance invite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser QR-Code ist keine Group-Balance-Einladung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a valid URL.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist keine gültige URL."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The admin token is the server's ADMIN_TOKEN. It lets this device create groups there; it never gives access to any group's contents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Admin-Token ist das ADMIN_TOKEN des Servers. Damit kann dieses Gerät dort Gruppen erstellen; Zugriff auf Inhalte einer Gruppe gibt es nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The faint bar shows where each balance lands once expected money arrives.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der blasse Balken zeigt, wo jeder Saldo landet, sobald das erwartete Geld angekommen ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fewest transfers that settle everyone, netted through the group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die wenigsten Überweisungen, mit denen alle quitt sind, über die Gruppe verrechnet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The group owes you money.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Gruppe schuldet dir Geld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The group stays on the server and with the other members. You can only come back with a new invite from the admin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Gruppe bleibt auf dem Server und bei den anderen. Zurück kommst du nur mit einer neuen Einladung vom Admin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This group": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Gruppe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This invite doesn't match a member of the group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Einladung passt zu keinem Mitglied der Gruppe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This invite has already been used or was revoked. Ask for a new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Einladung wurde schon benutzt oder zurückgezogen. Bitte um eine neue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link is not a valid Group Balance invite.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Link ist keine gültige Group-Balance-Einladung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This plan assumes the %@ still expected arrives. Settle once it has.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Plan geht davon aus, dass die noch erwarteten %@ ankommen. Begleiche erst, wenn das Geld da ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server doesn't speak protocol version 1.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Server spricht Protokollversion 1 nicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To join, ask the group's admin to add you and show you your invite QR code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Beitreten: Bitte den Admin der Gruppe, dich hinzuzufügen und dir deinen Einladungs-QR-Code zu zeigen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesamt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two people edited this at the same time. The later edit won.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zwei Personen haben das gleichzeitig bearbeitet. Die spätere Änderung gilt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount or a percentage per person. It counts once they confirm it arrived.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib pro Person einen Betrag oder Prozente ein. Es zählt, sobald der Eingang bestätigt ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Type an amount or a percentage per person. Leave everything empty if it belongs to whoever received it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib pro Person einen Betrag oder Prozente ein. Lass alles leer, wenn es dem gehört, der es bekommen hat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown date": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unbekanntes Datum"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown member": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unbekanntes Mitglied"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unreadable event": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlesbarer Eintrag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use an amount or a percentage like 15%.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erlaubt sind Beträge oder Prozente wie 15%."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for arrival": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wartet auf Eingang"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What arrived?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was ist angekommen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What for? e.g. Dinner": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wofür? z. B. Abendessen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What for? e.g. Project Nordlicht": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wofür? z. B. Projekt Nordlicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the money is in your account, confirm it under Waiting for arrival.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn das Geld auf deinem Konto ist, bestätige es unter „Wartet auf Eingang“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who gets the money?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer bekommt das Geld?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who paid?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer hat bezahlt?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who pays whom": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer zahlt wem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who pays whom changes as this money arrives.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer wem zahlt, ändert sich, sobald dieses Geld ankommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who received what, whom it belongs to, what has arrived, and who pays whom. Only members can read it, not even the server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer was bekommen hat, wem es gehört, was angekommen ist und wer wem zahlt. Lesen können es nur Mitglieder, nicht einmal der Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whom does it belong to?": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wem gehört es?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a server's admin token this device can create groups there. The token never gives access to any group's contents.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit dem Admin-Token eines Servers kann dieses Gerät dort Gruppen erstellen. Zugriff auf Inhalte einer Gruppe gibt das Token nie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You get": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bekommst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You join as the member this invite is for. Your key stays on your devices and in your iCloud Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du trittst als das Mitglied bei, für das diese Einladung ist. Dein Schlüssel bleibt auf deinen Geräten und in deinem iCloud-Schlüsselbund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You owe the group money.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du schuldest der Gruppe Geld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You paid it all.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast alles bezahlt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You pass on": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du gibst weiter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You pay": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du zahlst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You receive": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bekommst"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You'll get a QR code that lets only this person join, once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bekommst einen QR-Code, mit dem nur diese Person einmal beitreten kann."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're settled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du bist quitt."
